  <description>
    Differential-drive field UGV for CARMA. Carries a 0.12 m baseline stereo
    pair and a co-located depth camera, and publishes the robot-&gt;bridge
    topics named in ros2_ws/src/carma_bridge/README.md.
  </description>
</model>
